         <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFDiscovery.CDIFDiscovery"/>
         <body>CDIF Discovery profile module. Discovery-oriented extensions on top of a cdifCore Dataset: schema:measurementTechnique, schema:variableMeasured (VariableMeasured), schema:spatialCoverage (SpatialExtent with GeoSPARQL geometry), schema:temporalCoverage (TemporalExtent with OWL-Time Instant), dqv:hasQualityMeasurement. The catalog record MUST declare conformance to https://w3id.org/cdif/discovery/1.1.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>CDIFDiscovery</name>
      <URI>https://w3id.org/cdif/discovery/1.1/xmi/</URI>
